This project contains a C# source file named Program.cs.
It was set up and built using the .NET Framework 4.x.
The build process generates a project file, PhemApp.csproj, which defines the project configuration.
This file can be opened and managed in Visual Studio or any compatible .NET IDE.
From the project file, you can compile and run the application as needed.
To modify functionality, edit Program.cs and rebuild using the project file.
